# repos/ holds full third-party working clones used as research reference
# material (Dolphin, MinerU, docling, ...). It is intentionally NOT ignored:
# exclude it manually when staging a PR. Never run `git add repos/` or a blanket
# `git add -A` from here; each clone carries its own .git and would be added as a
# broken submodule gitlink. The committed findings live in the markdown reports
# next to this file; see repos/README.md.
